t-weight='600'>步骤</text><text x='717.0' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>结构化解题操作单元</text><line x1='848' y1='84' x2='874' y2='84' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M874 78 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='888' y='40' width='250' height='88' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='1013.0' y='78.0' font-size='20' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>套路（母题）</text><text x='1013.0' y='104.0' font-size='15' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>若干步骤的有序组合</text></svg><svg width={1140} height={120} viewBox='0 0 1140 120'><rect x='0' y='8' width='1140' height='96' rx='8' fill='#F5F7FA'/><text x='570' y='40' font-size='19' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>箭头统一表示：左侧是右侧学习或掌握的前置</text><text x='570' y='74' font-size='16' fill='#333A45' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>这是一条概念上的前置链，不表示各层一一对应，也不表示学生必须重新学习已掌握的内容</text></svg><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #1E7BE0', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>课时之间还有教学先后关系；若干课时讲授若干知识点，但不要求严格一一对应。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：项目名词与教学关系定义.md §1–§5</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 6 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>